  "releaseNotes": "Adds XUnitAssured.Http.AspNetCore: ApiFixture hosts your own ASP.NET Core API in memory for Given(fixture) and HttpTestBase, with a shared client, a new client per identity (ClientFor), clients with and without cookies, the API's services, and opt-in log capture that works with any logging library. Its documentation leads with sharing one instance across the suite through a collection fixture. No changes to existing packages. Upgrade guide: https://github.com/andrewBezerra/xunit-assured-net/blob/main/UPGRADING.md",
